s://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/java-archive","state":"uploaded","size":7028535,"digest":"sha256:1f964c6e36fa69f25ae2e847086e49c37489550581568e78a7128e1b0ef7071f","download_count":459,"created_at":"2026-03-22T00:09:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T00:09:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/download/v1.2.3/Toolscreen-1.2.3-double-click-me.jar"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/tarball/v1.2.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/zipball/v1.2.3","body":"Setup video: https://youtu.be/YqS-fxPx_jo\r\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n- Added browser overlays\r\n- Added dynamic image sizing (no squishing ninjabrainbot)\r\n- Added shift-layers for rebinding\r\n- Added realtime mirrors and gradient mirror output\r\n- Added animated GIF support for image overlays\r\n- Added support for rebinding the Windows key\r\n- Added a button to open custom cursor folder\r\n- Added Preemptive mode to the Basic tab\r\n- Added Simplified Chinese translations\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed Toolscreen not injecting into instances that use java.exe rather than javaw.exe\r\n- Fixed window being positioned weirdly when using F11 to exit fullscreen\r\n- Fixed static mirror borders being 1 frame behind\r\n- Fixed some issues with fullscreen mode slider sizing\r\n- Fixed custom cursor files not refreshing and cursor size not saving\r\n- Fixed old mode references remaining in hotkey configs\r\n- Fixed issues with eyezoom size settings updating while you're typing\r\n- Fixed some issues with RTSS\r\n- Fixed WM_CHAR rebinds spamming logs\r\n- Potentially fixed some instability issues on some systems\r\n## Changes\r\n- Significant performance improvements in some cases\r\n- Improved virtual camera performance and stability\r\n- Cleaned up the mirror settings UI\r\n- Added the borderless options into Advanced settings\r\n- Made it harder to accidentally change the default mode\r\n- Mirror sizes are now capped to 500x500 to discourage doing illegal things\r\n- Fixed the top left popup always saying Ctrl+i even if you changed hotkey\r\n\r\nHow to update: If you're on 1.0.6 or higher, just launch your instance and it will prompt you to update\r\nOtherwise, download the .jar below, put it in the instance folder, and double click it\r\n# Patreon\r\nIf you would like to support the future development of Toolscreen, you can [subscribe through Patreon](<https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777>), your name will show up in the Supporters tab of Toolscreen and you get access to exclusive supporter discord channels"}